Subject: [LOCAL, EXPERIMENTAL] dt-bindings: describe Exynos7570 stage0 target

Add the independently written SM-G570F board compatible, the hardware's
Exynos4210-compatible MCT instance and the diagnostic DTB build target.
The new DTS/DTSI sources are supplied from this repository's dts/ directory.
This is not a complete SoC binding or an upstream-reviewed board port.

